---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { COMPANY, CONTACT_LINKS, DISCLAIMER_SHORT, PRODUCTS } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Information on the Nirvigna website is general information only and is not legal advice. Regulated filings are done by a qualified CA/CS."
  lastUpdated="8 October 2026"
>
  <p><strong>{DISCLAIMER_SHORT}</strong></p>

  <h2>1. Information only</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on this website, including descriptions of licences, Acts, sections and industries, is general information. It is
    not legal, tax or professional advice and should not be relied on as a substitute for advice on your own situation.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Regulated filings</h2>
  <p>
    {COMPANY.brand} helps organise compliance work. Regulated filings, and any work that the law reserves for a professional, are
    done by a qualified CA/CS.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Product status</h2>
  <p>
    {PRODUCTS.compliance.name} is in early access and {PRODUCTS.foodSafety.name} is in development. Features described on this
    website may change, and coverage starts with Telangana.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Not a government body</h2>
  <p>
    {COMPANY.brand} is a private company. It is not part of, affiliated with or endorsed by any government department, regulator
    or licensing authority.
  </p>

  <h2>5. No promise of outcomes</h2>
  <p>
    Using {COMPANY.brand} does not mean an application will be granted, an inspection will go a certain way, or a penalty will be
    avoided. Those decisions rest with the relevant authorities.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this disclaimer: <a href={CONTACT_LINKS.email}>{COMPANY.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
